<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-family: &quot;Ciutadella regular&quot;, Arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 45px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: Ciutadella, Arial, Verdana, serif; line-height: 15px; height: 15px; width: 680px;"></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"></td></tr></tbody></table><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="" size="4" color="#333333"><b style="">Qantas &amp; <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Account.Name}</span>&nbsp;Corporate Agreement</b></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="" color="#666666">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" color="#666666">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="" color="#666666">I'm pleased to provide your renewed Qantas Airways Corporate Agreement which gives <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Account.Name}&nbsp;</span>domestic and international point-of-sale discounts, including MCA routes with our partner airline Emirates – connecting you to Europe, the Middle East, North Africa, South East Asia and New Zealand. We have also extended the discount off our Qantas Club membership.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" color="#666666">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="" color="#666666">There is<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> a </span><font style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">contract start date</font>&nbsp;of <b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">XXX</b> to your corporate agreement. Please sign and return your full agreement by <font style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);"><b>cut-off date for signing</b></font>&nbsp;so you can access your discounted airfares, and to also guarantee that your travel management company can access your discounted airfares.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" color="#666666">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" color="#666666">I look forward to working with you and continuing to build a great partnership between our companies. If you have any questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to contact me.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" color="#666666">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" color="#666666">Kind regards,</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" color="#666666">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-family: Arial, Ciutadella; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#666666"><strong style="">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}</strong><br>{!User.Title}<br><br>Qantas Inside Sales, Business &amp; Government Sales</font><br><font color="#666666">Qantas Airways Limited</font><br><br><font color="#666666">A Wing, Level 4, 10 Bourke Road, Mascot NSW 2020</font><br><font color="#666666">P. 13 10 85 Ext {!User.Extension}</font><br><font color="#666666">E.&nbsp;</font><a href="mailto:{!User.Email}" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">{!User.Email}</a><br></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-family: Arial, Ciutadella; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 9px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Qantas Privacy Notice</span><br>Qantas collects information about you (including health information where necessary) to provide products and services to you, process your travel arrangements, facilitate your participation in the loyalty programs of Qantas and other organisations, conduct marketing activities and market research. If the information is not provided Qantas may not be able to provide the service requested. Qantas may disclose your personal information to its related companies, other carriers, travel service providers, organisations which provide services to Qantas, third parties acting on Qantas' behalf, various law enforcement agencies and governments around the world for security, customs and immigration purposes. Further details can be found in our Privacy Statement on qantas.com. You can gain access to the information Qantas holds about you by contacting Qantas Corporate Sales on 13 10 85.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 15px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
